    {
      "author": "Tunde Oyelowo",
      "text": "Lot 9340-A had the March event too \u2014 the 2026-05 bulletin does not cover a second event. 9340-B is covered and clean.",
      "ts": "2026-05-11T10:20:00"
    },
    {
      "author": "C\u00e9lia Baptiste",
      "text": "Line 2 is three stations now, not the two on the old layout sheet. The short-series jig uses the S gauge family and its own lot.",
      "ts": "2026-05-11T10:31:00"
    },
    {
      "author": "S\u00f6ren Lindqvist",
      "text": "An expedited build would be mine to approve; nobody has asked.",
      "ts": "2026-05-11T10:44:00"
    }
  ],
  "thread_id": "CHAT-1008",
  "title": "DSGN-0008 pin gauge bulletin fallout"
}

